WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.452
Got a new order? Let's set it up as a project. It only takes a minute.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.902
Hit New project, down in the sidebar.

00:00:08.252 --> 00:00:11.182
First up, who's it for? Type in the customer.

00:00:14.211 --> 00:00:17.443
Give the project a name. The ID is suggested for you.

00:00:17.961 --> 00:00:21.411
Add the customer's PO number, and check the delivery date.

00:00:21.911 --> 00:00:25.305
How many different parts are on the order? We'll go with one.

00:00:25.805 --> 00:00:29.327
Now the part itself. A number, and a short description.

00:00:31.005 --> 00:00:34.248
Add the drawing number. You can upload the file here too.

00:00:34.748 --> 00:00:38.349
Tell quality what to check, like a dimension and its tolerance.

00:00:40.948 --> 00:00:43.040
Then how many, and at what price.

00:00:45.598 --> 00:00:48.131
Pick the material, and how much you'll need.

00:00:50.715 --> 00:00:53.422
Give it a quick check, and hit Create project.

00:00:54.122 --> 00:00:57.749
And there it is! One project, shared by every department.

00:01:00.672 --> 00:01:03.718
Nice work. Your new project is ready to roll.

